{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天王力宏昨晚（7日）於廣州開啟巡迴演唱會首場，驚喜邀請「甜心教主」王心凌擔任嘉賓。</p><p>這不僅是兩人出道多年的首度同台演出，王力宏更難得放下平時帥氣的形象，在台上大跳經典舞步並賣萌比愛心，極具反差感的演出引爆全場萬名歌迷尖叫。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.612914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"575863cc5fbfd6e6bf26eed578c8758e9ccce87a847240dd670b95890fba9753","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}